{
  "_meta": {
    "synthetic": true,
    "notes": "SYNTHETIC. A three-leg relay chain where the middle leg is the slow one: 32 kbps between two relays against 262 kbps either side of it. The contribution's whole job is that join, so the scene has to be a route with more than one hop in it, and the rates have to differ or there is no bottleneck to flag. Node ids match `comms.path`'s own `from`/`to`, which is how the schedule joins them."
  },
